.TH PICFIND 1 "2026-08-11" "PicFind 0.1"
.SH NAME
picfind \- hide and recover messages in PNG images using LSB steganography
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B picfind encode
.RI " [options]"
.br
.B picfind decode
.RI " [options]"
.br
.B picfind capacity
.RI " [options]"
.br
.B picfind show
.RI " [options]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
PicFind hides text or binary files inside PNG images using least-significant-bit encoding. It supports optional compression and password-based encryption.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
picfind encode --image cat.png --message "secret" --output secret.png
.TP
picfind encode --image cat.png --input-file payload.bin --output secret.png
.TP
picfind decode --image secret.png --out-file recovered.bin
.SH OPTIONS
See the README.md for full usage and examples.
.SH AUTHORS
Written by the PicFind tooling team.
*** End Patch